    ModularCurve.FullLevel.isIntegral_adjoin_j0_levelModuliPackageAbs_of_isUnit_two_three_gamma0Pow A q ℓ M' hℓ3 hℓA hM'A h2A h3A hℓ hM 𝒢 h𝒢 h𝒢O 𝒯 h𝒯 hVC hCO P₀
  have hdom := ModularCurve.FullLevel.comap_adjoin_jZero_eq_bot_of_mem_minimalPrimes_gamma0Pow q hq M' hqM' ℓ hℓ3 hℓq hℓM' L ξ hξ hιξ K hK A hAq j hj hℓA hM'A hℓ hM 𝒢 h𝒢 h𝒢O 𝒯 h𝒯 hVC hCO P₀
